  (text "Input USB-C PD 15-20 V (TPS25730D, also a MacBook charger; the DC input is removed, R205) -> EXT; EXT and two 3S packs (each with its own BQ25798 charger from EXT) -> ideal diodes (LM74700) -> rear On/Off switch -> BUS 9-24 V (packs 9-12.6 V) -> 19 V internal rail (LM5176) -> 15 V H5 (LMR33640), +5V_PANEL and +5V (TPS54560B), +-14 V (LMR33640) -> +-12 V (TPS7A47 / TPS7A33), +48 V (LM5156H + TPS7A4101)" (at 25.4 15.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5afea911-01b7-5e03-bd08-186326924d81)
  )
